      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――黄金世代。那是普通人绝对无法触及的领域，\n跨越了重重困难的4人正要前往那里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "597e49617db69f3334bc7967d47bdeb7533e776e9b20527a193c4c91fe2af98f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
