      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正因为无人缺席，才能创造出这样的奇迹。\n以成为这个世代的领头羊为目标\n――现在，4人将全力以赴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01a66561b761b063f5b53e1e00a0e24226fbbbabb59588b94414b32d66a30d61",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
